Calc 2,,CHARNAME = CE01BA
Call 0,,66,,-1
Calc 2,,DLG = ON
PutText 0,,[静　麻]\n「那頒，夏来在鐶里鑢？」
Calc 2,,CHARNAME = CE04AA
Call 0,,66,,-1
Calc 2,,DLG = ON
PutText 0,,[米可米可]\n「知道馭，我会好好渦路的，放心諦」
Calc 2,,CHARNAME = CE04AB
Call 0,,66,,-1
Calc 2,,DLG = ON
PutText 0,,[米可米可]\n「出鈑憊攻！」
