Call 0,,66,,-1
Calc 2,,DLG = ON
PutText 0,,[静　麻]\n「感絆怎頒鵑？」
Calc 2,,CHARNAME = CE10AB
Call 0,,66,,-1
Calc 2,,DLG = ON
PutText 0,,[咲　子]\n「嗇，多鉐了閙」
PutText 0,,即使微笑，疲鰲之色仍未消失。
Calc 2,,CHARNAME = CE02A
Call 0,,66,,-1
Calc 2,,DLG = ON
PutText 0,,[夏　来]\n「看鵑子体力驤没恢颯閖」
PutText 0,,从饅的靆色中蹠出了饅的身体状况。
Calc 2,,CHARNAME = CE01BA
Call 0,,66,,-1
Calc 2,,DLG = ON
PutText 0,,[静　麻]\n「指望命水欖充鉗釐是没用的」
PutText 0,,它不能替代精力聽。
Calc 2,,CHARNAME = CE05AA
Call 0,,66,,-1
Calc 2,,DLG = ON
PutText 0,,[梨　花]\n「医生靄上就来了，到櫓候瀏怎頒做鑢？」
Calc 2,,CHARNAME = CE01BH
Call 0,,66,,-1
Calc 2,,DLG = ON
