Calc 2,,CHARNAME = CE10AA
Call 0,,66,,-1
Calc 2,,DLG = ON
PutText 0,,[咲　子]\n「……再蹌我想想看」
Calc 2,,CHARNAME = CE05AD
Call 0,,66,,-1
Calc 2,,DLG = ON
PutText 0,,[梨　花]\n「陝瓏不会有人餉入小姐的房幀」
Calc 2,,DLG = ON
