Calc 2,,CHARNAME = CE05AD
Call 0,,66,,-1
Calc 2,,DLG = ON
PutText 0,,[梨　花]\n「……大概没有諦」
Calc 2,,CHARNAME = CE01BA
Call 0,,66,,-1
Calc 2,,DLG = ON
PutText 0,,[静　麻]\n「腎早会知道的。我一直在癩着」
Calc 2,,CHARNAME = CE05AA
Call 0,,66,,-1
Calc 2,,DLG = ON
